+The bound W25 regression comprises 240 passing tests across the Desktop coordinator, ControlDaemon, ArtifactStore, selector loader, UIA/AX gateways, ScreenCaptureKit adapter, and host security provider. Strict network guard recorded seven active child-entrypoint events and zero blocked attempts. It establishes software contracts and fail-closed behavior only. It does not prove the presence or correctness of COMSOL controls, OS permission grants, UIA/AX selectors, native capture, active-model binding on a real desktop, COMSOL Save Copy, numerical state preservation, or Windows/macOS runtime support. Native Windows UIA, macOS AX/ScreenCaptureKit and COMSOL execution remain `NOT_RUN`.
